      ],
      "text": {
        "hi": "किताब की पूरी तालिका ऐसे भरो। शेर: golden brown, meat, big, forest। हाथी: gray, leaves, grass and fruits, very big, forest। कुत्ता: black, brown or white, bread, milk and meat, medium, our homes। बिल्ली: many colours, milk and fish, small, our homes।",
        "hinglish": "Kitaab ki poori taalika aise bharo. Sher: golden brown, meat, big, forest. Haathi: gray, leaves, grass and fruits, very big, forest. Kutta: black, brown or white, bread, milk and meat, medium, our homes. Billi: many colours, milk and fish, small, our homes.",
        "en": "Fill the book's table like this. Lion: golden brown, meat, big, forest. Elephant: gray, leaves, grass and fruits, very big, forest. Dog: black, brown or white, bread, milk and meat, medium, our homes. Cat: many colours, milk and fish, small, our homes."
      }
